# BuildKit reads this file for packaging/docker/Dockerfile only, so it can exclude far more
# than a repo-wide .dockerignore could. The engine build needs the crates, the Python package,
# and the manifests; everything else only slows the context upload.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!.cargo/
!crates/
!python/
!wheelhouse/
crates/**/target/
python/batcher/_native*.so
python/batcher/_native*.pyd
**/__pycache__/
